                  "content": "# Billing disputes\n\nBilling questions are classified by `classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts`. A message containing the exact lowercase substring `refund` is classified as `refund-review`; every other message passed to the classifier is classified as `invoice-question`.\n\nThese values label a support request. They do not approve a refund, determine whether an invoice is correct, or perform a billing action. Support responses must remain grounded in available project evidence and identify missing information instead of inventing an outcome.\n",
